This guy is literally one of the funniest/best profs you'll ever have. he's super easy to talk to and makes tons of jokes! my vocal stim from his class is "let's close the poll" &#129315;&#129315;&#129315;&#129315;&#129315;
if u can take him, u should
but beware his practice exams are nothing like the actual ones, but that doesn't mean his exams r hard, it's all conceptual

The class is really annoying. It's so dependent on exams and quizzes, there are no other way to make up points. You are often given MCAT questions too. 

The professor definitely lacks in explaining concepts with extreme clarity. There are always communication issues. 

I'd advise you to take this class at a community college or some place else &#129326;
